# p5 mcp: what the servers block says of a server's tools across two turns.
# Turn one calls the fixture's tool by name, with no search first (0fb5cb8e):
# its first request names no tool count, as fx v0.0.16's catalog has not read
# the list yet; the call reads it. Turn two's request counts the tools
# (`modelSnapshot`, src/core/mcp_host/model.zig:472-500@481104fd).
# The stdio server is p5-mcp-stdio.ts, which the profile names by `@BUN@` and
# `@SCENARIOS@` (capture.sh writes both in), and xfx is given the same profile.
fx: homefile .fx/mcp.json p5-mcp-turn-profile.json
xfx: homefile .xfx/mcp.json p5-mcp-turn-profile.json
gateway p5-mcp-known-turns.json
fx: env FX_PERMISSION_MODE=full-access
xfx: env XFX_PERMISSION_MODE=yolo
wait 6
type call the fixture echo tool
key Enter
wait 10
type and once more
key Enter
wait 8
snap turn
gwlog
